im] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]provider_drain.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provider-drain planning and execution engine[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: select the agents a disabled provider stranded, classify each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one's reroute or refusal through the existing restart and launch-guard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machinery, and execute the moves.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase agent drain command and durable operation[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the `sase agent drain` subcommand with preview, confirmation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]receipt, and JSON envelope, and register it as the `agent.drain` durable[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Automatic drain on a usage-limit disable[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]auto[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto: gate the feature behind a beta flag, submit a drain proc when a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]usage-limit disable wins its first-writer window, and make that drain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]own the single enriched usage-limit notification.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch Control relaunch prompt after a manual disable[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: after a manual hard disable in the Models panel, offer a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-keypress relaunch chooser and submit the drain as a durable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked proc.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end drill and reference documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]soak[dim] · [dim][/dim]after auto, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]soak: prove the whole loop through the fakey provider end to end and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document draining in the LLM provider reference.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-su","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-su.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-83ed2cdba5cee3e35e6c722600ab495f","started_at":"2026-08-24T15:04:00.850533+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"289fa68ebc73dc2af6d1606ef6e3ccd41aec566980710d27b7ec662c97f12d73","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"fd6b3a04d00717e36ddc1ea26367a80692cab635eeb26781f9679e0a3629292f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"5d2f9c2482d349b05fbf32a476d9e99c399567fa0dbdb2254a558a2c7f4ae649","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"state":{"digest":"900de86f6b3413cb1a889836d28e6d513dd26b2979a0e0f90c2551c3fed74d30","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2","local_name":"sase-su.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-su","agent_clan_generation":"20260824110331","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-su.2","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-su","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5",